<p>Inspect the final facts independently of the clients’ responses.</p>
<Sql code={inspect} label="Check every class counter against its committed reservation count" />
<p>These observations cover selected schedules on one engine. They do not prove every writer follows the protocol, test a power cut, or measure production throughput. A counterexample disproves safety; a passing run needs the argument alongside it. Write down the invariant, list every writer, state the read contract, identify what protects each decision through commit, define abort handling, and force the cases that would fail if that protection were missing.</p>

